<title>ITALY: TABLE-Italy records bop deficit in June.</title>
<headline>TABLE-Italy records bop deficit in June.</headline>
<dateline>ROME 1997-07-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Italy's overall balance of payments recorded a 1.137 trillion lire deficit in June, the Italian Foreign Exchange Office said.</p>
<p>BALANCE OF PAYMENTS (In billions of lire)</p>
<p>			    June 97	  May 97   June 96</p>
<p> Total		     -1.137	  +1.571   +6.770</p>
<p>  -Year to date	  -2.206	  -1.058   +24.496</p>
<p> Capital movements     -8.771	  -3.018   -1.705</p>
<p>  -Year to date	  -8.391	  -76 bln  +13.624</p>
<p>-- Rome newsroom +396 678 2501</p>
</text>
